Embedded icons
---------------

The offline HTML report embeds six regular weight Phosphor icons as an inline SVG sprite.
They are shipped in the installed wheel, are not fetched at runtime, and are recorded with
digests in src/nhi_blast/report/assets/MANIFEST.json.

  Phosphor Icons (copy, check, printer, arrow-up, arrow-right, info)
  Copyright (c) 2023 Phosphor Icons
  https://github.com/phosphor-icons/core
  License: MIT (full text in src/nhi_blast/report/assets/icons/MIT-Phosphor.txt)

Vendored JavaScript
-------------------

The offline HTML report embeds the official Motion 14.7.1 UMD build as an
inline script behind a CSP hash. It is shipped in the installed wheel, is not
fetched at runtime, and is recorded with its digest in
src/nhi_blast/report/assets/MANIFEST.json.

  Motion
  Copyright (c) 2024 Motion B.V.
  https://motion.dev
  License: MIT (full text in
  src/nhi_blast/report/assets/vendor/MIT-Motion.txt)

Platform data
-------------

The files under src/nhi_blast/data/ describe GitHub Actions and AWS IAM
behaviour. Each file records its primary source URL and the date on which it was
verified; see docs/data-provenance.md. Those documents remain the property of
their respective publishers and are not redistributed here. The data files are
this project's own summaries, not copies of vendor documentation.

Runtime dependencies (installed separately, not vendored)
---------------------------------------------------------

pydantic, PyYAML, networkx, typer, click and their transitive dependencies are
distributed under their own licences. Optional extras add rich (MIT) and
python-hcl2 with lark and regex (MIT). None of these packages is bundled in the
